## 3. Canonical tensor shapes / dtypes

| Symbol     | Producer          | Shape                   | Dtype   | Notes                                           |
|------------|-------------------|-------------------------|---------|-------------------------------------------------|
| `pts`      | preprocess        | `(N, 4)` per frame      | float32 | `[x, y, z, intensity]`, LiDAR frame             |
| `bev_feat` | PointPillars neck | `(B, 384, 248, 216)`    | float32 | CUDA                                            |
| `tok_grid` | SpatialReducer    | `(B, Nt=16, D=256)`     | float32 | 4×4 grid pool                                   |
| `seq_tok`  | stack over T_ctx  | `(B, T_ctx*Nt, D)`      | float32 | `T_ctx = 10` → `L = 160`                        |
| `h_T`      | Mamba             | `(B, D=256)`            | float32 | Streaming `step()` in Stage B carries hidden    |
| `logits`   | RiskHead          | `(B, 3)`                | float32 | no sigmoid inside; use `BCEWithLogitsLoss`      |
| `p_risk`   | sigmoid(logits)   | `(B, 3)`                | float32 | `[p_05s, p_1s, p_2s]`                           |
| `s`        | `env.read_proprio`| `(B, d_s)`              | float32 | `d_s ≈ 10 + A` minimal, up to ~50 with joints   |
| `a_t`      | Actor sample      | `(B, A)`                | float32 | `A = 3` default: `(v_x, v_y, ω_yaw)`, tanh-squashed |

Mamba `T_ctx = 10` at 20 Hz = 0.5 s history. Keep this constant unless you update `docs/strategy_full_pipeline.md` § 6.4.2 in the same PR.

